  "bug_discussion": "Upstream PR #14134 describes invalid argv/key access on IO threads for commands with invalid arity and possible Redis crash, naming merged PR #14017 as the regression. Its exact merge commit is the selected mainline fix. A local GCC+ASan same-input preflight with io-threads=2 returned a normal arity error on the introducing commit's parent and the fixing commit, while the introducing revision entered Redis serverPanic at db.c:2931. This demonstrates a command-triggered denial of service, not an ASan-proven out-of-bounds access. Current Redis Clang14 configuration fails to compile the unmodified 2025 source; security screening, normal task construction, and Docker verification remain pending.",
